<title>USA: Seagate in settlement on class lawsuits.</title>
<headline>Seagate in settlement on class lawsuits.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTS VALLEY, Calif. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seagate Technology Inc Wednesday said it reached tentative settlements on two separate securities class action lawsuits filed against the company and the company's wholly owned subsidiary, Conner Peripherals Inc.</p>
<p>In a statement, Seagate said the settlements, which are subject to court approval and completion of appropriate settlement agreements, have had an insignificant impact on the company's financial results and should have no adverse affect on the company's ongoing operations or financial results.</p>
</text>
